WEBVTT

01:47.300 --> 01:51.940
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:52.060 --> 01:54.980
[Episode 22]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:54.980 --> 02:02.700
[Equality for Everyone, Justice in Administration]

02:07.500 --> 02:09.740
[Equality for Everyone, Justice in Administration]

02:12.960 --> 02:13.570
Laogou.

02:14.560 --> 02:15.780
You asked me to bring you here.

02:16.630 --> 02:17.780
Did you recall something?

02:39.360 --> 02:40.450
You fired a gun here.

02:44.710 --> 02:45.450
Laogou.

02:45.750 --> 02:47.220
It's a complicated story.

02:47.590 --> 02:48.660
Did you

02:49.240 --> 02:49.980
fire a gun here or not?

02:57.310 --> 02:58.290
Take your gun out.

02:58.910 --> 02:59.850
And shoot once more.

03:04.430 --> 03:05.010
What?

03:06.680 --> 03:07.820
Afraid that my memories will come back?

03:23.360 --> 03:24.010
Open fire.

03:30.150 --> 03:30.820
Again.

03:38.750 --> 03:40.010
Zhang Qishan!

03:41.240 --> 03:42.340
Again.

03:48.310 --> 03:49.010
Again!

03:50.460 --> 03:52.690
Again. Again!

04:01.150 --> 04:01.940
Colonel Hatoyama.

04:05.430 --> 04:06.290
Colonel Hatoyama.

04:07.280 --> 04:08.380
How much longer do we need?

04:09.590 --> 04:10.890
Qingwuzi said

04:11.960 --> 04:13.850
the gate was here.

04:14.750 --> 04:16.780
We need to operate the mechanism six times

04:16.800 --> 04:17.730
to open it.

04:18.070 --> 04:19.700
Operate it six times.

04:20.040 --> 04:21.290
How many times has it been now?

04:21.680 --> 04:22.660
The sixth, sir.

04:23.160 --> 04:23.700
The mechanism.

04:24.040 --> 04:25.050
The mechanism is unlocked.

04:26.560 --> 04:28.900
Qingwuzi is right.

04:39.430 --> 04:40.310
Let's go.

04:41.190 --> 04:41.660
Yes.

04:53.510 --> 04:54.220
Spare him.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.290
- No. - Master.

04:58.390 --> 04:59.050
No!

05:00.750 --> 05:01.340
No!

05:02.360 --> 05:02.850
No!

05:03.120 --> 05:03.660
No!

05:03.870 --> 05:04.540
No!

05:05.190 --> 05:05.810
Laogou.

05:05.870 --> 05:06.460
Master!

05:10.070 --> 05:10.660
No.

05:20.480 --> 05:22.140
No.

05:25.000 --> 05:26.050
What is going on?

05:29.920 --> 05:31.250
Did you recall something?

05:31.920 --> 05:32.610
Yes.

05:33.510 --> 05:34.370
I feel

05:35.870 --> 05:36.930
brokenhearted.

05:37.680 --> 05:38.490
I am upset.

05:40.870 --> 05:41.980
I also saw the Japanese.

05:44.950 --> 05:46.220
But I couldn't recall

05:46.950 --> 05:48.250
what exactly happened.

05:58.240 --> 05:59.340
Can you let me try it?

06:07.680 --> 06:08.170
Laogou.

06:08.560 --> 06:09.580
What are you doing?

06:10.000 --> 06:10.410
Freeze.

06:10.800 --> 06:11.460
Put down the gun.

06:13.190 --> 06:14.370
What in the world?

06:14.750 --> 06:15.810
Did you

06:17.000 --> 06:18.020
kill my man here?

06:18.830 --> 06:20.220
I knelt and begged you,

06:21.000 --> 06:21.980
but you didn't spare him.

06:23.720 --> 06:24.140
Yes.

06:24.480 --> 06:25.050
Why?

06:25.310 --> 06:26.370
Because he violated the law.

06:28.510 --> 06:29.050
Laogou.

06:29.310 --> 06:29.700
It's

06:29.950 --> 06:31.460
not what you think it is.

06:31.750 --> 06:32.700
Put down the gun.

06:33.120 --> 06:33.810
Master Zhang

06:33.830 --> 06:34.610
can explain everything.

06:36.240 --> 06:37.220
Don't just stand there.

06:37.360 --> 06:38.580
Talk to your master now.

06:39.390 --> 06:40.020
Master.

06:40.510 --> 06:42.170
It's not what you think it is.

06:42.270 --> 06:42.850
Don't...

06:42.870 --> 06:43.660
Shut up!

06:45.190 --> 06:46.610
I can't even remember myself.

06:47.630 --> 06:48.410
I can't tell

06:49.510 --> 06:50.660
if you're lying to me or not.

06:56.720 --> 06:58.020
You can lie to one

06:58.630 --> 06:59.580
or two people.

07:00.560 --> 07:02.020
But you can't lie to everyone in the city.

07:02.680 --> 07:03.730
I want to find out

07:04.870 --> 07:06.410
what kind of person

07:07.160 --> 07:08.610
stays by my side every day.

07:13.240 --> 07:14.220
I want them to tell me

07:15.750 --> 07:17.490
if you have hurt the people,

07:18.070 --> 07:19.220
if you have betrayed your friends,

07:19.720 --> 07:20.370
or if you

07:20.390 --> 07:21.660
have any secret dealings.

07:22.360 --> 07:23.730
No, Fifth Master.

07:23.870 --> 07:25.850
Master Zhang isn't someone like that.

07:26.000 --> 07:27.540
He's a righteous officer.

07:27.630 --> 07:28.700
Yes, Fifth Master.

07:29.600 --> 07:30.660
You are kind to us,

07:31.000 --> 07:32.140
but Master Zhang

07:32.390 --> 07:34.410
is also our benefactor.

07:34.870 --> 07:35.340
That's right.

07:35.360 --> 07:36.900
- After Master Zhang came to Changsha, - I agree.

07:37.070 --> 07:38.540
our lives took a turn

07:38.720 --> 07:40.250
for the better.

07:40.360 --> 07:41.580
Right, everyone?

07:41.720 --> 07:43.900
- Yes. - Yes.

08:19.360 --> 08:20.810
I can tell you

08:22.680 --> 08:23.900
what happened back then.

08:26.920 --> 08:27.540
No need.

08:30.870 --> 08:31.810
I just wanted to make sure

08:33.320 --> 08:35.010
that you didn't kill the innocent.

09:17.790 --> 09:18.610
The Japanese

09:19.320 --> 09:20.770
brought me to this place.

09:21.840 --> 09:22.770
It's a stage.

09:23.480 --> 09:25.010
There were three people in opera costumes.

09:25.600 --> 09:26.490
The child in the middle

09:27.200 --> 09:28.580
was kneeling at the center.

09:31.150 --> 09:32.250
Great, Fifth Master.

09:32.600 --> 09:33.770
You recalled something.

09:34.600 --> 09:35.460
What you drew

09:35.910 --> 09:37.250
is Madam Wang's Lecture.

09:38.840 --> 09:40.130
What is Madam Wang's Lecture?

09:40.510 --> 09:41.730
It's...

09:43.480 --> 09:44.250
Continue.

09:48.910 --> 09:50.370
Someone opened fire.

09:51.720 --> 09:52.820
But I'm not sure who they were shooting at.

09:53.510 --> 09:54.890
And someone was talking.

09:56.360 --> 09:57.250
He kept saying

09:59.910 --> 10:01.820
Seioutsu, Rokkai.

10:05.030 --> 10:05.940
Seioutsu, Rokkai.

10:06.750 --> 10:07.980
Seioutsu, Rokkai?

10:10.390 --> 10:12.490
Seioutsu...

10:12.790 --> 10:13.820
Rokkai...

10:14.270 --> 10:15.490
What does it mean, Fifth Master?

10:16.360 --> 10:17.180
I don't know.

10:18.080 --> 10:18.770
But they

10:19.390 --> 10:20.580
probably weren't speaking Chinese.

10:22.480 --> 10:23.820
When he said Rokkai,

10:24.840 --> 10:25.890
a gate opened.

10:26.480 --> 10:27.490
Then he brought me

10:27.670 --> 10:28.700
to a river.

10:29.200 --> 10:29.700
No.

10:30.910 --> 10:31.580
It was not a river.

10:32.790 --> 10:33.650
It wasn't outside.

10:35.120 --> 10:36.340
But I could hear the sound of water.

10:38.870 --> 10:39.980
Underground river.

10:42.150 --> 10:43.060
Fifth Master, you're right.

10:43.600 --> 10:44.300
Hatoyama

10:44.790 --> 10:45.890
took the underground river.

10:46.790 --> 10:47.300
But

10:48.000 --> 10:49.420
how did they get down?

10:50.270 --> 10:50.940
Could it be

10:52.080 --> 10:53.700
they descended

10:54.000 --> 10:54.850
from the stage?

10:58.030 --> 11:00.130
You said Rokkai.

11:00.630 --> 11:01.340
Say it again.

11:02.000 --> 11:04.340
Seioutsu, Rokkai.

11:04.630 --> 11:05.370
Louder.

11:07.000 --> 11:08.820
Seioutsu, Rokkai.

11:12.870 --> 11:13.850
Seioutsu, Rokkai.

11:14.630 --> 11:16.490
It's Qingwuzi, six times, in Japanese.

11:17.030 --> 11:18.420
Qingwuzi?

11:21.750 --> 11:22.460
I remember it now.

11:22.960 --> 11:24.580
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama mentioned in his report

11:24.720 --> 11:25.580
that he found the Otherworld Tower

11:25.600 --> 11:26.420
when he was studying

11:26.600 --> 11:27.650
Qingwuzi.

11:28.030 --> 11:29.490
Perhaps it's the stage layout?

11:30.790 --> 11:32.180
But we did it correctly thrice.

11:32.630 --> 11:34.490
Do we have to do it three more times?

11:35.080 --> 11:35.820
Impossible.

11:36.320 --> 11:37.340
You can only rearrange the stage

11:37.550 --> 11:38.700
three times.

11:38.840 --> 11:39.850
There's no other way.

11:41.240 --> 11:42.580
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama knows far more

11:42.910 --> 11:43.940
than what we do.

11:44.360 --> 11:46.580
He probably learned that by studying Qingwuzi.

11:46.840 --> 11:47.700
If that's the case,

11:48.270 --> 11:50.010
Qingwuzi might be the key

11:50.200 --> 11:52.100
that leads us to the underground river.

11:52.790 --> 11:53.250
Tiezui.

11:53.790 --> 11:54.530
I'll put you in charge of this.

11:54.840 --> 11:55.580
Find out everything.

11:56.080 --> 11:56.820
Yes, Master Zhang.

11:59.000 --> 11:59.940
We'll head to Xie Jiu

12:00.320 --> 12:01.610
and tell him

12:01.910 --> 12:02.580
what happened.

12:03.060 --> 12:05.460
[Otherworld Tower Map]

12:11.440 --> 12:12.770
What we know for sure

12:13.600 --> 12:15.010
is that beneath the stage of Madam Wang's Lecture

12:15.030 --> 12:15.770
is the entrance

12:16.270 --> 12:18.250
of the underground river.

12:18.250 --> 12:19.360
[Underground River]

12:19.360 --> 12:20.940
And this underground river

12:21.840 --> 12:23.010
is the passage

12:23.550 --> 12:25.220
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama used to enter the Xumi Realm.

12:26.910 --> 12:27.850
Let's lay down

12:28.000 --> 12:29.100
the details of our plan.

12:29.870 --> 12:30.580
Master Zhang,

12:31.440 --> 12:33.010
I don't mean to offend you,

12:34.030 --> 12:35.250
but before we make

12:35.270 --> 12:36.060
a plan,

12:36.510 --> 12:37.580
shouldn't we find out

12:37.670 --> 12:38.770
what is inside the Xumi Realm?

12:39.120 --> 12:40.610
That way, we know what we're getting into.

12:41.030 --> 12:41.490
Go ahead.

12:43.000 --> 12:44.460
If you remember,

12:44.870 --> 12:45.490
Ding Qiansui

12:46.120 --> 12:46.980
was imprisoned

12:47.000 --> 12:47.850
deep inside

12:48.150 --> 12:49.220
the secret cell under Master Zhang's residence.

12:50.320 --> 12:51.130
How did

12:51.670 --> 12:53.610
Hatoyama pierce through his chest

12:53.720 --> 12:54.820
and kill him

12:55.200 --> 12:56.130
with his hand?

13:05.360 --> 13:05.850
Also,

13:06.720 --> 13:08.180
that Japanese soldier who went to get water.

13:09.080 --> 13:10.700
No matter how many times we killed him,

13:11.150 --> 13:12.460
he always came back alive.

13:19.120 --> 13:19.700
Moreover,

13:20.150 --> 13:21.490
Master Zhang, you killed

13:21.550 --> 13:22.340
a Zhainiangniang.

13:32.560 --> 13:33.860
Judging from its serial number,

13:34.320 --> 13:36.060
it's not the only one.

13:37.120 --> 13:38.220
In the Xumi Realm,

13:38.960 --> 13:39.890
there might

13:40.080 --> 13:41.730
be more monsters like it.

13:43.360 --> 13:44.730
Tiezui is right.

13:45.480 --> 13:46.420
Be it

13:46.440 --> 13:48.100
killing someone remotely

13:48.510 --> 13:49.820
and bringing the dead back,

13:51.120 --> 13:52.420
Hatoyama must have only mastered

13:52.870 --> 13:54.250
all these tricks upon entering

13:54.270 --> 13:54.980
the Xumi Realm.

13:55.480 --> 13:56.820
Otherwise, he would have already killed you

13:57.270 --> 13:58.580
when you were in the Otherworld Tower.

13:58.910 --> 13:59.610
Yes.

14:00.030 --> 14:01.010
That's what I mean.

14:01.840 --> 14:02.820
The Xumi Realm

14:03.440 --> 14:04.340
is dangerous.

14:05.080 --> 14:05.890
And the Otherworld Tower

14:06.630 --> 14:08.580
is just the appetizer

14:09.000 --> 14:11.220
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama left us

14:11.670 --> 14:12.770
to keep us intrigued.

14:13.150 --> 14:14.650
If it's just an appetizer,

14:15.550 --> 14:16.730
let's talk about the main dish.

14:17.790 --> 14:18.650
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

14:18.670 --> 14:20.370
knows our literature

14:20.960 --> 14:22.180
and mystic arts very well.

14:23.000 --> 14:24.610
If his study continues,

14:25.080 --> 14:26.730
he will become a threat.

14:27.080 --> 14:29.220
We need to eliminate him as soon as possible.

14:29.550 --> 14:30.340
But Master Zhang,

14:31.030 --> 14:31.940
Hatoyama

14:32.270 --> 14:33.460
leads a troop that he has trained

14:33.480 --> 14:34.300
for years.

14:35.150 --> 14:36.220
They are elite soldiers.

14:36.840 --> 14:38.220
The Xumi Realm is dangerous.

14:38.670 --> 14:39.890
If you want to mobilize your men,

14:40.320 --> 14:41.460
you need to send in at least

14:41.600 --> 14:42.530
a company

14:42.600 --> 14:43.460
to fight them.

14:43.870 --> 14:46.180
But Changsha is in a delicate

14:46.200 --> 14:46.980
situation,

14:47.150 --> 14:48.850
and Huo Wenhai is watching you closely.

14:49.390 --> 14:51.060
If you mobilize your men now,

14:51.240 --> 14:51.770
it might...

14:52.000 --> 14:52.650
You're right.

14:53.440 --> 14:54.770
A big number is a disadvantage,

14:55.320 --> 14:56.730
and it might even draw attention.

14:57.440 --> 14:58.130
We

14:58.480 --> 14:59.730
must handle this matter swiftly.

15:01.750 --> 15:03.890
Like how?

15:05.960 --> 15:06.850
I'll take Xiaoyu

15:08.960 --> 15:09.770
and you

15:10.240 --> 15:11.130
with me

15:11.480 --> 15:12.340
to capture Hatoyama.

15:13.910 --> 15:14.530
Master Zhang,

15:15.030 --> 15:16.100
I'll stay out of this.

15:16.510 --> 15:17.010
You see,

15:17.200 --> 15:18.610
you want to capture Hatoyama.

15:19.270 --> 15:20.340
My presence

15:20.390 --> 15:21.650
is a dead weight.

15:22.200 --> 15:23.300
I shouldn't be there.

15:23.480 --> 15:24.490
- I shouldn't be there. - Have I not

15:24.510 --> 15:25.650
made myself clear just now?

15:26.270 --> 15:28.180
Hatoyama is an expert in mystic arts.

15:28.630 --> 15:29.130
Among everyone here,

15:30.000 --> 15:31.250
only you have knowledge of it.

15:31.670 --> 15:32.610
You must come with us.

15:34.670 --> 15:35.220
Master Zhang,

15:35.480 --> 15:36.820
- I should... - Sit down.

15:42.790 --> 15:43.220
Master Zhang.

15:43.480 --> 15:44.420
What about this?

15:44.550 --> 15:46.460
We can communicate using pigeons.

15:47.030 --> 15:48.060
I'll wait for you in Xiangxi.

15:48.630 --> 15:49.610
If I come with you,

15:49.790 --> 15:50.820
you have to capture the culprit

15:50.910 --> 15:51.730
while protecting me.

15:52.320 --> 15:52.730
I'll just

15:53.120 --> 15:54.460
be an extra burden.

15:55.270 --> 15:56.340
I should sit this one out.

15:57.870 --> 15:58.460
I'll go with you.

16:00.150 --> 16:00.850
Laogou.

16:01.750 --> 16:02.980
Now is not the time to...

16:03.030 --> 16:03.650
This monster here.

16:04.440 --> 16:05.250
I think I've seen it.

16:07.030 --> 16:08.530
You remember this monster?

16:11.480 --> 16:12.770
I can't recall everything now.

16:13.120 --> 16:14.100
But I'm sure

16:14.480 --> 16:15.420
I've seen it.

16:16.030 --> 16:18.250
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama laid down an elaborate trap

16:18.270 --> 16:19.650
in the Otherworld Tower

16:20.200 --> 16:21.220
to capture you.

16:22.320 --> 16:22.980
And

16:23.200 --> 16:24.700
you have a very powerful talent.

16:25.510 --> 16:26.490
You can tame animals.

16:27.000 --> 16:27.700
You

16:28.000 --> 16:29.010
tamed this monster.

16:31.200 --> 16:31.890
I tamed

16:31.910 --> 16:32.610
this monster?

16:33.360 --> 16:33.730
Yes.

16:34.200 --> 16:34.940
Am I that good?

16:35.670 --> 16:36.610
Yes.

16:38.200 --> 16:39.060
No wonder.

16:39.630 --> 16:40.650
No wonder you spent your family fortune

16:40.670 --> 16:41.490
to get me back.

16:42.270 --> 16:43.100
You really know what's good for you.

16:43.840 --> 16:44.700
Laogou.

16:45.870 --> 16:46.650
It was Xie Jiu

16:46.670 --> 16:47.980
who spent his family fortune.

16:48.320 --> 16:49.490
What are you on about?

16:49.670 --> 16:50.370
It's fine.

16:50.840 --> 16:51.650
It's for the Mystic Nine.

16:52.390 --> 16:53.940
I'm doing this for Master Zhang.

16:55.910 --> 16:56.340
Master Zhang,

16:56.720 --> 16:57.890
if I have tamed this monster,

16:58.320 --> 16:59.370
then I play an important role

16:59.390 --> 16:59.850
in this matter.

17:00.150 --> 17:00.980
All the more reason for me to come.

17:01.120 --> 17:01.820
No.

17:02.750 --> 17:03.460
Why?

17:04.590 --> 17:05.980
I cannot fight

17:06.160 --> 17:07.090
while ensuring your safety.

17:07.240 --> 17:08.050
Ensuring my safety?

17:09.000 --> 17:10.140
If you can protect Tiezui,

17:10.240 --> 17:11.250
you can protect me as well.

17:11.510 --> 17:12.140
Besides,

17:12.440 --> 17:13.380
I can fight too.

17:13.480 --> 17:14.700
I can protect myself.

17:14.830 --> 17:15.570
No.

17:16.880 --> 17:18.090
You lost your memories.

17:18.590 --> 17:19.770
You will rest here and recover.

17:20.240 --> 17:20.810
I am already implicated

17:20.830 --> 17:21.810
in this matter.

17:22.160 --> 17:23.010
You said yourself

17:23.640 --> 17:24.770
that I had tamed this monster.

17:25.160 --> 17:25.700
If the Japanese

17:25.720 --> 17:26.730
use it to kill someone,

17:27.030 --> 17:27.900
that makes me

17:27.920 --> 17:28.770
a murderer.

17:29.510 --> 17:30.140
Also,

17:30.590 --> 17:31.620
I can see many images

17:32.000 --> 17:33.250
in my head.

17:34.110 --> 17:35.250
I can't recall everything now,

17:35.550 --> 17:36.460
but if I go back there,

17:36.680 --> 17:37.810
I might recall everything.

17:38.240 --> 17:38.860
I have to be there.

17:43.000 --> 17:43.980
He's right.

17:46.110 --> 17:47.290
No.

17:47.480 --> 17:47.860
You...

17:52.030 --> 17:52.700
Laogou.

17:52.790 --> 17:53.250
Laogou.

17:55.000 --> 17:55.490
Master Zhang.

17:55.750 --> 17:56.140
This is...

18:03.750 --> 18:04.660
Just tell me

18:05.070 --> 18:06.570
why you must join us.

18:11.480 --> 18:12.490
Like you, I want

18:13.400 --> 18:14.570
to protect everyone in this city.

18:17.070 --> 18:18.570
If you can do it,

18:19.400 --> 18:20.660
so can I.

18:27.350 --> 18:27.810
All right.

18:28.790 --> 18:29.570
You can come with us.

18:30.310 --> 18:30.980
However,

18:31.590 --> 18:32.730
you will stay by my side

18:33.000 --> 18:34.010
during the whole journey.

18:34.830 --> 18:35.380
Don't worry.

18:36.110 --> 18:36.730
Tiezui and I

18:36.880 --> 18:37.730
will be under your command.

18:38.440 --> 18:38.940
Master Zhang,

18:39.790 --> 18:40.810
let me join you.

18:41.030 --> 18:41.940
No.

18:42.480 --> 18:43.090
Why?

18:43.310 --> 18:44.530
You'll hold the fort in Changsha.

18:48.720 --> 18:49.140
Xie Jiu.

18:50.400 --> 18:51.460
After we go down,

18:52.000 --> 18:53.490
Huo Wenhai will surely do something.

18:53.880 --> 18:54.530
Please

18:54.550 --> 18:55.330
protect yourself.

18:55.510 --> 18:56.380
Don't do anything reckless.

18:56.790 --> 18:57.810
Don't worry, Master Zhang.

18:58.550 --> 18:59.940
I always pick my battles.

19:03.270 --> 19:03.770
Master Zhang.

19:05.960 --> 19:06.770
Take care.

19:10.700 --> 19:15.700
[Taihe Pleasure House]

19:16.960 --> 19:18.050
Master Zhang, it's right inside.

19:24.640 --> 19:25.530
Come.

19:32.210 --> 19:32.900
Wow.

19:33.590 --> 19:34.250
It's so deep.

19:34.720 --> 19:35.250
Master Zhang,

19:36.030 --> 19:37.290
this well is how Ding Qiansui

19:37.440 --> 19:38.220
dropped supplies

19:38.240 --> 19:39.380
to the Japanese.

19:40.720 --> 19:41.660
We widened the passage

19:41.680 --> 19:42.290
several days ago.

19:42.790 --> 19:43.940
It now leads directly to the Otherworld Tower.

19:48.240 --> 19:48.700
Laogou.

19:51.070 --> 19:52.010
This is yours.

19:52.240 --> 19:53.620
You know how to use it.

20:02.880 --> 20:03.660
It's all mine?

20:05.510 --> 20:06.940
The descent will be long

20:07.640 --> 20:08.380
and fast.

20:08.550 --> 20:09.730
Make sure you keep up with me.

20:10.160 --> 20:10.700
Don't worry.

20:12.310 --> 20:12.810
Let's go.

20:28.490 --> 20:29.180
Careful.

20:31.830 --> 20:32.290
Master Zhang.

20:33.030 --> 20:33.810
You're so fast.

20:34.880 --> 20:36.180
You were very agile too.

20:37.830 --> 20:38.620
You merely forgot.

20:41.400 --> 20:41.980
Really?

20:43.240 --> 20:44.730
I really want to regain my memory soon.

20:49.200 --> 20:50.770
We searched several times after we widened the passage,

20:51.000 --> 20:52.090
but we found nothing.

20:52.720 --> 20:54.010
So this is the Otherworld Tower?

20:56.720 --> 20:57.940
This place collapsed once.

20:58.400 --> 20:59.250
The situation is unclear.

20:59.790 --> 21:00.490
Be vigilant.

21:02.350 --> 21:02.860
Understood.

21:04.350 --> 21:04.980
I'll follow you.

21:12.070 --> 21:12.810
Understood.

21:13.310 --> 21:14.090
I'll follow you.

21:19.160 --> 21:19.730
All right.

21:19.880 --> 21:20.660
I can walk.

21:27.400 --> 21:27.940
Master Zhang.

21:28.240 --> 21:29.290
I've gone through the ancient records.

21:29.960 --> 21:31.460
You need to rearrange the stage six times.

21:32.350 --> 21:32.980
Arrange it

21:33.440 --> 21:34.460
correctly three times.

21:35.240 --> 21:36.290
Then incorrectly for another three times.

21:37.200 --> 21:38.460
The entrance to the underground river

21:38.550 --> 21:39.220
will then appear.

21:39.510 --> 21:40.660
Why the hassle?

21:41.310 --> 21:42.660
I'm not the Otherworld Patriarch.

21:43.160 --> 21:43.940
How would I know?

21:49.310 --> 21:49.730
Master Zhang.

21:50.310 --> 21:50.900
This follows

21:50.920 --> 21:52.290
the Li's Calculations of Five.

21:52.680 --> 21:53.490
Three rights, three wrongs.

21:53.880 --> 21:54.620
Mix rights in wrongs.

21:55.030 --> 21:55.810
Mix wrongs in rights.

21:57.030 --> 21:58.010
We did

21:58.030 --> 21:58.900
three rights, two wrongs last time.

22:00.550 --> 22:02.010
If we arrange it incorrectly one more time,

22:03.160 --> 22:04.460
will Peng Qiao appear?

22:05.310 --> 22:05.810
That's right.

22:07.160 --> 22:08.220
Wait by the entrance.

22:08.680 --> 22:10.140
I'll revisit the place with Fifth Master.

22:12.960 --> 22:14.010
You told me last time about

22:14.510 --> 22:15.620
Peng Ju and Peng Zhi.

22:16.830 --> 22:18.220
It's Peng Qiao this time.

22:19.160 --> 22:19.900
What

22:19.920 --> 22:20.770
is it?

22:22.350 --> 22:23.330
You'll find out soon.

22:23.830 --> 22:24.220
I...

22:39.480 --> 22:40.940
That's all you got, Peng Qiao?

22:46.960 --> 22:48.290
Did you recall anything?

22:48.640 --> 22:49.660
My friend,

22:50.960 --> 22:52.380
you could've helped me kill it.

22:52.960 --> 22:54.220
Must I do it myself?

22:56.880 --> 22:57.730
Next time,

22:58.200 --> 22:59.460
don't force me

23:00.270 --> 23:01.620
if I can't recall anything.

23:02.350 --> 23:03.730
Otherwise, I'll die in your hands

23:04.160 --> 23:05.490
before we reach the Xumi Realm.

23:30.480 --> 23:30.900
Master.

23:31.240 --> 23:32.140
I found another contraption.

23:33.000 --> 23:33.700
It's well hidden.

23:34.310 --> 23:35.290
No wonder I didn't notice it before.

23:37.750 --> 23:39.180
Help me get up at least.

23:45.400 --> 23:45.900
Let's go.

23:53.480 --> 23:54.460
I came

23:55.440 --> 23:56.620
to ask you for a favor.

23:57.680 --> 23:59.770
I hope you can ask

24:00.110 --> 24:00.810
your men

24:01.270 --> 24:02.250
to bring me to the Xumi Realm.

24:10.000 --> 24:11.330
When Fifth Master of the Mystic Nine

24:11.350 --> 24:12.940
escaped from the underground river in Xiangxi,

24:13.790 --> 24:15.010
the people from Xinyue Restaurant

24:15.110 --> 24:16.010
fished him out.

24:17.350 --> 24:18.380
Just tell me

24:18.830 --> 24:20.180
the exit of the underground river.

24:20.790 --> 24:21.980
I can follow upstream

24:22.440 --> 24:23.330
and find a way in.

24:26.200 --> 24:27.700
That's a death wish,

24:27.720 --> 24:28.250
miss.

24:28.880 --> 24:29.570
Just give up on it.

24:30.160 --> 24:30.980
My men

24:31.000 --> 24:32.250
have investigated that river.

24:33.510 --> 24:34.330
It's very dangerous.

24:35.240 --> 24:36.460
Not only does it have a complicated system

24:36.480 --> 24:37.380
of undercurrents,

24:37.680 --> 24:38.660
but it also houses

24:38.750 --> 24:39.940
a giant beast.

24:40.640 --> 24:41.180
If you...

24:41.200 --> 24:42.980
The danger will not dissuade me.

24:47.400 --> 24:48.530
Why are you so stubborn?

24:52.590 --> 24:53.940
Must you

24:55.030 --> 24:56.770
go there?

25:07.480 --> 25:08.220
Truth be told,

25:08.790 --> 25:10.250
when I went to the Otherworld Tower

25:10.270 --> 25:11.420
with Master Zhang,

25:12.750 --> 25:14.330
it was to settle my clan's debts.

25:15.030 --> 25:16.090
That was why I worked

25:16.110 --> 25:17.220
as Ding Qiansui's informant

25:17.750 --> 25:18.980
and did his bidding.

25:19.960 --> 25:21.530
At first, I thought it was just a simple job.

25:22.680 --> 25:23.730
But many things

25:23.790 --> 25:24.940
have happened down there.

25:25.680 --> 25:26.490
Master Zhang and the rest

25:26.830 --> 25:27.900
went through a lot.

25:28.590 --> 25:29.860
So did I.

25:32.070 --> 25:33.530
This time, they went to the Xumi Realm

25:33.960 --> 25:35.420
to end things for good.

25:36.440 --> 25:37.810
I can't just stand around and do nothing.

25:39.110 --> 25:39.810
Besides,

25:41.030 --> 25:42.330
I also have some knowledge

25:43.110 --> 25:44.460
that might be important to them.

25:45.920 --> 25:47.620
So you don't think that Zhang Qishan

25:47.640 --> 25:48.730
can settle the whole thing.

25:50.440 --> 25:51.140
I do.

25:52.400 --> 25:53.180
But it doesn't mean

25:53.790 --> 25:54.530
my responsibility ends here.

25:54.960 --> 25:56.620
There are things I must do.

25:58.830 --> 25:59.940
Please have faith in me.

26:00.830 --> 26:01.620
I do not

26:01.680 --> 26:02.900
fight a losing battle.

26:09.720 --> 26:11.330
You're just like my daughter.

26:11.960 --> 26:13.250
So opinionated.

26:13.960 --> 26:15.330
She never listens to me.

26:16.440 --> 26:16.980
We all

26:18.110 --> 26:18.810
want to walk

26:18.830 --> 26:20.090
our own path.

26:21.680 --> 26:22.250
Fine.

26:23.030 --> 26:24.180
If that is your final decision,

26:25.680 --> 26:26.620
and you don't regret it,

26:27.550 --> 26:29.010
I'll ask Gun Yi to go with you.

26:30.000 --> 26:30.940
He has a good memory

26:31.310 --> 26:32.220
and can fight very well.

26:33.680 --> 26:34.220
Thank you.

26:36.400 --> 26:37.140
Thank you, Godfather.

26:39.300 --> 26:42.380
[Changsha Garrison Command]

26:47.310 --> 26:47.940
Officer Huo.

26:48.270 --> 26:48.900
You need me?

26:49.510 --> 26:50.420
Zhang Wenshu.

26:51.070 --> 26:52.860
I received an urgent telegram from the Ministry of War.

26:53.550 --> 26:54.570
It says there have been

26:54.590 --> 26:56.570
cultist activities in Changsha

26:56.640 --> 26:57.940
and the city's safety is compromised.

26:58.510 --> 27:00.420
Defense Commander Zhang Qishan

27:00.510 --> 27:01.530
has abandoned his post.

27:03.070 --> 27:04.940
Garrison Captain Xu Renqing is thereby appointed

27:05.000 --> 27:06.530
as the interim Defense Commander

27:07.000 --> 27:07.860
in charge of this case.

27:08.920 --> 27:10.460
It's an order from the Ministry of War.

27:12.160 --> 27:13.090
Cultist activities?

27:13.960 --> 27:14.490
Sir,

27:15.030 --> 27:15.730
this is a serious matter.

27:16.310 --> 27:17.810
We have never heard about it before.

27:18.030 --> 27:19.090
And now, we are changing the defense commander?

27:19.960 --> 27:21.050
Besides, we did not receive

27:21.070 --> 27:21.900
the notice either.

27:22.400 --> 27:23.940
Right. This is a big problem

27:23.960 --> 27:24.860
but where is your commander?

27:25.920 --> 27:26.700
Should we wait

27:26.720 --> 27:27.700
until the cultists

27:27.720 --> 27:28.620
burn our city

27:28.720 --> 27:29.460
before we beg you

27:29.480 --> 27:30.570
to appoint a new defense commander?

27:34.350 --> 27:35.460
You guys

27:36.160 --> 27:37.140
have worked a lot lately.

27:37.310 --> 27:38.090
You've done well.

27:38.480 --> 27:39.770
And I see that.

27:41.830 --> 27:43.530
So I found an opportunity

27:43.550 --> 27:45.140
to give you and your men

27:45.240 --> 27:46.570
some respite.

27:48.440 --> 27:49.090
Please

27:49.830 --> 27:51.010
hand over the task.

27:55.110 --> 27:55.700
Allow me

27:57.000 --> 27:57.620
to verify the order.

28:02.640 --> 28:03.770
Do you not trust me?

28:08.240 --> 28:09.010
Verify it.

28:10.830 --> 28:11.730
Take it with you.

28:12.240 --> 28:13.090
Take your time.

28:21.440 --> 28:22.770
Zhang Qishan's office

28:22.790 --> 28:23.620
needs to be vacated.

28:24.400 --> 28:25.290
Bring some men with you.

28:26.350 --> 28:27.250
Be cordial.

28:27.830 --> 28:29.050
We wouldn't want to tire the Zhang Clan's soldiers.

28:30.240 --> 28:30.700
Yes.

28:38.240 --> 28:39.420
[Notice]
A new order from the garrison!

28:40.110 --> 28:41.770
The Honghua cult has spread

28:42.400 --> 28:43.570
[Xiangchun Gate]
into Changsha.

28:43.940 --> 28:45.190
They are a dangerous cult.

28:45.640 --> 28:46.420
From now on,

28:46.720 --> 28:48.330
Changsha will be placed under curfew.

28:48.750 --> 28:50.660
No one can go out unless you hold

28:51.000 --> 28:51.980
a special pass.

28:52.880 --> 28:54.090
Those who sneak out

28:54.510 --> 28:55.940
will be punished according to the military rules.

29:09.830 --> 29:10.290
Something bad has happened.

29:12.550 --> 29:13.860
They are appointing a new defense commander.

29:14.400 --> 29:15.330
Xu Renqing will take over.

29:15.920 --> 29:16.940
It seems like Huo Wenhai

29:17.160 --> 29:18.860
is stirring up trouble again when Master is away.

29:22.200 --> 29:22.810
Listen carefully.

29:23.680 --> 29:24.420
I need you

29:24.720 --> 29:25.530
to do something.

29:27.780 --> 29:31.980
[Xiangxi]

29:38.720 --> 29:39.250
Miss Huo.

29:39.790 --> 29:40.940
The chests came from upstream.

29:41.270 --> 29:42.250
We fished them out here.

29:46.070 --> 29:46.570
Thanks.

29:46.830 --> 29:48.140
I'll take over from here.

29:48.680 --> 29:49.090
Oh.

29:49.480 --> 29:50.770
Master prepared some supplies

29:50.790 --> 29:51.460
for you.

29:51.880 --> 29:52.860
The underground river is convoluted.

29:53.200 --> 29:53.730
Please exercise caution.

29:55.070 --> 29:55.490
Thanks.

30:19.480 --> 30:20.050
Careful.

30:39.590 --> 30:40.460
We finally found the exit.

31:03.830 --> 31:04.250
Master.

31:05.240 --> 31:06.290
The grass has been stepped on

31:06.310 --> 31:07.380
and pulled.

31:08.310 --> 31:09.010
The Japanese

31:09.510 --> 31:10.660
must have come out

31:11.000 --> 31:11.570
to this place.

31:13.200 --> 31:14.940
This is a key passage to the Xumi Realm.

31:15.270 --> 31:16.140
By right,

31:16.480 --> 31:17.700
it should be heavily guarded.

31:18.310 --> 31:19.860
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama is meticulous.

31:20.160 --> 31:21.380
He knows Laogou has escaped,

31:21.790 --> 31:23.460
so he must have predicted that I would come here.

31:24.510 --> 31:25.730
However, there are no guards.

31:26.310 --> 31:27.660
It might be a trap.

31:28.270 --> 31:29.220
Stay vigilant, everyone.

31:30.110 --> 31:30.530
Master Zhang,

31:31.350 --> 31:32.140
perhaps

31:32.310 --> 31:34.140
Fifth Master and I will return to the underground river

31:34.350 --> 31:35.290
and wait for your updates?

31:35.750 --> 31:36.460
- No. - No.

31:38.310 --> 31:39.570
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama knows

31:39.590 --> 31:40.290
that we are in the mountains.

31:40.720 --> 31:41.620
From now on,

31:42.000 --> 31:43.090
do not leave the formation.

31:43.550 --> 31:44.620
Xiaoyu, watch him closely.

31:44.880 --> 31:45.220
Yes.

31:45.480 --> 31:46.050
I'll follow you.

31:53.000 --> 31:53.570
Eighth Master.

32:04.480 --> 32:05.010
Master Zhang.

32:05.590 --> 32:06.770
Do you think there are

32:07.350 --> 32:08.700
Zhainiangniangs in this mountain?

32:42.400 --> 32:42.860
Master.

32:43.440 --> 32:44.290
Everything is burnt to a crisp.

32:45.350 --> 32:46.570
Given the number of items here,

32:46.880 --> 32:47.860
there should've been some residue.

32:49.270 --> 32:50.620
They probably stationed some men here to make sure

32:50.960 --> 32:52.180
that nothing was left behind.

32:52.920 --> 32:54.010
This is how a special agent

32:54.110 --> 32:54.730
usually leaves a scene.

32:56.070 --> 32:57.140
If this is just to set up

32:57.160 --> 32:58.010
an ambush,

32:58.310 --> 32:58.980
it'll be an overly

32:59.590 --> 33:00.530
costly ambush.

33:01.270 --> 33:02.660
They burned all their watches.

33:03.440 --> 33:04.010
For some reason.

33:06.110 --> 33:07.090
Perhaps time doesn't matter

33:07.750 --> 33:08.660
where they go.

33:09.790 --> 33:10.860
It'll only be a burden.

34:02.000 --> 34:02.940
This cave

34:03.480 --> 34:04.980
sounds like a clock.

34:05.920 --> 34:06.980
It's the sound made by the wind

34:07.240 --> 34:08.460
between the rocks.

34:44.280 --> 34:45.340
Fingers are numb.

34:49.320 --> 34:50.300
Do you recall anything?

34:53.030 --> 34:54.530
But I drew this picture.

34:55.400 --> 34:56.420
They burned everything.

34:57.030 --> 34:57.820
But why did they

34:57.960 --> 34:59.210
keep the papers?

34:59.920 --> 35:01.170
There are claw marks.

35:01.880 --> 35:02.740
Something dangerous

35:02.760 --> 35:03.690
might have happened here.

35:08.880 --> 35:10.130
I used to stay here.

35:13.230 --> 35:13.690
Master.

35:14.670 --> 35:15.380
It's a dead end.

35:46.480 --> 35:47.170
I was

35:48.440 --> 35:49.490
afraid of this place.

35:51.550 --> 35:52.940
What was in here?

35:55.480 --> 35:56.650
Probably what

35:56.710 --> 35:57.690
I killed.

36:00.040 --> 36:01.300
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

36:02.920 --> 36:04.220
imprisoned you here

36:04.920 --> 36:05.860
to tame the Zhainiangniang.

36:07.960 --> 36:09.010
When we were in Xiangxi,

36:09.030 --> 36:09.940
we found out

36:10.280 --> 36:11.300
that the Japanese had mastered

36:11.440 --> 36:13.090
how to tame a Zhainiangniang.

36:21.840 --> 36:22.820
Give me some time.

36:23.280 --> 36:24.340
I'll recall everything.

36:26.400 --> 36:27.490
Just give me some time.

36:28.110 --> 36:28.860
I'll recall

36:28.880 --> 36:30.260
everything that happened here.

36:31.800 --> 36:32.300
Laogou.

36:33.590 --> 36:34.570
Give me some time.

36:35.110 --> 36:36.050
Give me some time.

36:39.960 --> 36:41.210
In an operation, do not

36:41.840 --> 36:43.090
get carried away by your emotion.

36:44.360 --> 36:45.340
Do not obsess over it.

36:46.360 --> 36:47.460
Otherwise, you'll be trapped in it.

36:49.400 --> 36:50.650
Our priority now

36:51.480 --> 36:52.610
is to locate Hatoyama.

36:53.760 --> 36:55.170
Hatoyama has abandoned this camp.

36:55.880 --> 36:56.530
They probably

36:57.070 --> 36:58.650
are heading to the Xumi Realm.

36:59.510 --> 37:00.380
We have

37:00.670 --> 37:01.690
to find a way in quickly.

37:07.360 --> 37:08.490
I will recall everything.

37:10.230 --> 37:10.650
Come.

38:26.590 --> 38:27.010
Master.

38:27.710 --> 38:28.460
We have been following

38:28.480 --> 38:29.210
the Japanese's trail.

38:29.510 --> 38:30.460
Is there going to be a trap?

38:31.070 --> 38:32.170
There are only four of us.

38:33.590 --> 38:34.650
We would have already died if there was a trap.

38:35.070 --> 38:36.170
They could've attacked us anytime.

38:36.510 --> 38:37.260
Just proceed.

38:46.480 --> 38:47.980
No flies in here.

38:48.440 --> 38:49.340
How weird.

38:54.020 --> 38:54.640
Wow.

38:57.030 --> 38:58.530
What is this tall wall?

39:03.590 --> 39:05.340
It's the wall of the Otherworld Tower.

39:08.400 --> 39:09.170
Xingxiu seal.

39:10.280 --> 39:11.170
It's the same.

39:11.800 --> 39:12.300
Master Zhang.

39:12.550 --> 39:13.900
Is this a new Otherworld Tower?

39:14.400 --> 39:15.130
Or...

39:16.800 --> 39:17.530
Or could it be that

39:18.440 --> 39:19.860
we're back in Changsha?

39:21.360 --> 39:22.490
This is not Changsha.

39:23.230 --> 39:24.210
It's a new place.

39:28.480 --> 39:29.610
How are you so sure?

39:29.960 --> 39:31.210
Because our ropes are not here.

39:36.360 --> 39:36.940
Right.

39:37.880 --> 39:38.900
Master Zhang.

39:38.960 --> 39:40.300
You're entering it just like that?

39:40.630 --> 39:42.650
It's the Japanese's territory.

39:43.960 --> 39:44.650
Master Zhang!

40:25.320 --> 40:26.860
Laogou's mark.

40:59.550 --> 41:00.570
A passage underwater.

41:27.920 --> 41:28.780
Laogou's secret code.

41:29.710 --> 41:30.940
It probably means it's the entrance.

41:32.960 --> 41:34.420
It seems like I can get there from underwater.

41:51.900 --> 41:53.740
[Xumi Realm]

42:00.440 --> 42:02.300
Xumi Realm.

42:04.150 --> 42:05.490
This is the Xumi Realm?

42:06.760 --> 42:07.380
Perhaps

42:08.590 --> 42:09.530
the Xumi Realm

42:10.480 --> 42:11.980
is another Otherworld Tower?

42:19.230 --> 42:20.300
But it doesn't make sense.

42:24.400 --> 42:25.900
Why is it so new?

42:29.190 --> 42:30.260
By right,

42:31.150 --> 42:32.300
the Otherworld Patriarch

42:32.320 --> 42:33.490
built the Otherworld Tower back then

42:34.190 --> 42:34.860
to enter

42:34.880 --> 42:35.860
the Xumi Realm.

42:37.000 --> 42:38.010
Therefore,

42:38.590 --> 42:39.570
the Xumi Realm

42:40.110 --> 42:41.940
should be older than the Otherworld Tower.

42:42.710 --> 42:43.860
But it looks

42:44.670 --> 42:46.210
so fresh, like it's newly built.

42:46.710 --> 42:48.130
Fresh paint on an old stele?

42:49.230 --> 42:50.050
Something's afoot.

42:54.480 --> 42:54.860
Master.

42:55.440 --> 42:56.570
The walls around us are solid.

42:56.800 --> 42:57.420
No secret passage

42:58.030 --> 42:59.010
or contraption.

43:02.800 --> 43:04.130
Where did the Japanese go then?

43:06.670 --> 43:07.210
Master Zhang.

43:08.000 --> 43:08.460
Look.

43:08.710 --> 43:09.530
The murals are different.

43:10.800 --> 43:11.380
Master Zhang,

43:11.960 --> 43:13.340
it probably is the various spells

43:13.760 --> 43:15.610
from various sects.

43:16.670 --> 43:17.300
You have

43:18.760 --> 43:19.900
Soultrap Spell,

43:21.590 --> 43:22.460
Illusion Dispelling Chant,

43:22.460 --> 43:23.100
[Illusion Dispelling Chant]

43:23.360 --> 43:24.260
Mind Manipulation,

43:24.260 --> 43:24.800
[Teleportation]

43:24.800 --> 43:25.780
and Teleportation.

43:26.630 --> 43:27.340
So

43:27.960 --> 43:28.860
the Xumi Realm

43:30.070 --> 43:31.980
is a repository of spells.

43:33.400 --> 43:33.860
Then,

43:34.230 --> 43:35.170
in that case,

43:35.800 --> 43:36.820
Hatoyama came here

43:36.840 --> 43:37.690
to learn spells.

43:38.070 --> 43:38.740
When he mastered them,

43:38.920 --> 43:40.460
he returned to Japan with the spells.

43:42.070 --> 43:43.490
Let's finish reading first.

43:49.190 --> 43:49.860
Master Zhang.

43:51.400 --> 43:52.570
I think I know

43:53.110 --> 43:54.650
why it's a dead end here.

43:56.030 --> 43:57.570
It says there's a spell

43:58.550 --> 43:59.570
called Tower Cultivation.

43:59.660 --> 44:00.320
[Tower Cultivation]

44:00.320 --> 44:01.490
[Tower Cultivation]
It means

44:02.190 --> 44:02.860
while it's

44:03.550 --> 44:06.010
a dead end,

44:06.280 --> 44:07.860
it is not the end.

44:08.440 --> 44:10.380
It needs to be grown.

44:11.480 --> 44:12.820
Nourish the seed

44:13.320 --> 44:14.610
with fire and water.

44:15.110 --> 44:15.780
Then,

44:17.190 --> 44:18.650
the tower shall rise,

44:18.960 --> 44:20.380
and the door shall open.

44:22.000 --> 44:22.530
Master Zhang.

44:23.110 --> 44:24.130
In other words,

44:24.510 --> 44:26.420
the dead end here means

44:27.000 --> 44:29.010
that the seed hasn't sprouted yet.

44:29.760 --> 44:30.980
Once the spell is activated,

44:31.360 --> 44:32.090
the tower

44:32.480 --> 44:33.530
will sprout.

44:38.190 --> 44:38.980
Is it

44:40.360 --> 44:43.260
waiting for us to plant a seed?

44:45.000 --> 44:45.860
What seed?

44:48.670 --> 44:49.050
I...

44:49.800 --> 44:51.530
It doesn't say how.

44:53.110 --> 44:54.300
But to grow something,

44:54.960 --> 44:56.380
you plant a seed

44:57.110 --> 44:57.820
and water it.

44:59.230 --> 45:00.460
But the problem is...

45:05.230 --> 45:06.460
Where do we plant it?

45:07.150 --> 45:08.380
What is the seed?

45:14.480 --> 45:16.050
This stele, perhaps?

45:18.880 --> 45:19.860
Is it

45:20.480 --> 45:21.010
the seed

45:21.030 --> 45:22.010
of the Xumi Realm?

45:33.440 --> 45:34.210
Laogou!

45:34.710 --> 45:36.260
When we're this deep,

45:36.670 --> 45:38.340
we have to be cautious.

45:38.590 --> 45:39.570
How else are we supposed to grow it?

45:40.440 --> 45:41.460
A calabash will sprout

45:41.550 --> 45:42.900
within three days.

45:43.400 --> 45:44.740
Is it going to take three years

45:45.230 --> 45:46.380
to grow a tower?

45:46.590 --> 45:47.740
It's a spell.

45:48.510 --> 45:49.980
We can't measure it

45:50.000 --> 45:50.610
with time.

45:51.760 --> 45:52.650
Anyway, I highly doubt

45:52.840 --> 45:54.170
that the stele is the seed.

45:55.590 --> 45:56.490
So how do we grow it?

45:59.550 --> 46:02.610
If it needs to sprout

46:04.480 --> 46:06.420
and expand,

46:08.630 --> 46:10.420
do you think

46:12.320 --> 46:14.130
that perhaps the seed

46:17.710 --> 46:19.460
is actually this entire area?

46:33.630 --> 46:34.650
It doesn't work.

46:35.510 --> 46:36.130
Let me try that spot.

46:42.150 --> 46:42.690
Master,

46:43.630 --> 46:44.900
are we really growing a tower here?

46:47.360 --> 46:48.900
It doesn't hurt to let them try.

46:49.590 --> 46:50.570
More importantly,

46:50.590 --> 46:51.460
the Japanese were here.

46:53.280 --> 46:54.340
But it's all sealed shut.

46:54.710 --> 46:55.690
How did they get in?

46:56.630 --> 46:58.300
It must be a trick.

46:59.280 --> 47:00.610
Since this place shares the same layout

47:00.920 --> 47:02.050
as the Otherworld Tower

47:02.070 --> 47:02.860
in Changsha,

47:09.440 --> 47:10.740
let's dig a passage here

47:10.760 --> 47:11.780
like we did

47:12.630 --> 47:13.650
last time.

47:14.190 --> 47:14.650
Yes.

47:31.900 --> 47:36.060
♪The past fades like smoke♪

47:36.420 --> 47:39.140
♪A choice is made in silence♪

47:39.420 --> 47:42.220
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

47:42.620 --> 47:46.380
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

47:46.620 --> 47:50.060
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

47:50.340 --> 47:53.740
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

47:53.820 --> 48:01.100
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

48:01.540 --> 48:04.820
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

48:05.100 --> 48:08.340
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

48:08.500 --> 48:12.540
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

48:12.740 --> 48:16.100
♪Who believes in fate?♪

48:16.340 --> 48:19.700
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

48:19.940 --> 48:23.220
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

48:23.540 --> 48:27.220
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

48:27.420 --> 48:30.660
♪Take care♪

48:30.660 --> 48:33.220
♪We once raced♪

48:33.300 --> 48:35.220
♪For the dawn♪

48:35.380 --> 48:38.660
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

48:38.780 --> 48:42.060
♪In the web of fate♪

48:42.060 --> 48:45.260
♪No one can escape♪

48:46.260 --> 48:48.100
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

48:48.260 --> 48:49.820
♪We too were young once♪

48:49.900 --> 48:53.340
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

48:53.540 --> 48:55.860
♪Keep the ember lit♪

48:55.980 --> 49:00.500
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

49:00.620 --> 49:03.580
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

49:03.820 --> 49:07.340
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

49:07.460 --> 49:11.220
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

49:11.540 --> 49:15.020
♪Who believes in fate?♪

49:15.180 --> 49:18.180
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

49:18.420 --> 49:22.180
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

49:22.340 --> 49:26.060
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

49:26.180 --> 49:37.620
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
